            "body_content": "<p>Have a formal dress code on the calendar? Our lineup of floor-length gowns and formal dresses will ensure you look and feel your best. With luxe fabrications, flattering silhouettes, and perfect price points, this collection of black tie-ready dresses has exactly what you need for every charity gala, formal dance, or any celebration that calls for doing the most (in the best way!)</p>"
